  "releaseNotes": "### Built-in browser\n\n- On supported Macs, use Touch ID with passkeys you register in Pudding's built-in browser.\n- Handle web alerts, confirmations, and prompts. Browser actions can target frames and popups, hover over elements, and wait for page changes.\n\n### Conversations and widgets\n\n- Browse conversation activity and earlier turns with a simpler activity rail, improved previews, and smoother scrolling.\n- Develop widgets from a local folder with live reload and keep the last working preview while fixing a source error.\n- See tool output text by default. You can turn it off in settings.",
